#. module: account_internal_transfer
#. odoo-python
msgid ""
"A currency exchange needs journals in different currencies. Use an internal transfer "
"when both journals share the currency."
msgstr ""
"Un cambio de divisa necesita diarios en monedas distintas. Use una transferencia "
"interna cuando ambos diarios comparten la moneda."

