#. module: account_internal_transfer
msgid ""
"Confirming the document creates the outgoing payment and the incoming payment.\n"
"                A currency exchange also posts the difference between the company "
"rate and your rate."
msgstr ""
"Al confirmar se crean el pago de salida y el pago de entrada.\n"
"                Un cambio de divisa también publica el diferencial entre la tasa de "
"la compañía y su tasa."

#. module: account_internal_transfer
msgid "Create an internal transfer or a currency exchange"
msgstr "Cree una transferencia interna o un cambio de divisa"

