msgid "Set %(accounts)s in Accounting settings before posting this exchange difference."
msgstr ""
"Configure %(accounts)s en los ajustes de Contabilidad antes de publicar este "
"diferencial."

#. module: account_internal_transfer
#. odoo-python
msgid ""
"Set the internal transfer account in Accounting settings before confirming this "
"transfer."
msgstr ""
"Configure la cuenta de transferencia interna en los ajustes de Contabilidad antes de "
"confirmar."

